# Keeps the build context small AND, more importantly, keeps local secrets
# out of any image built from this repo root — .dockerignore is evaluated
# before the first COPY, so none of these ever reach the daemon, let alone
# a layer. Dockerfile.api only COPYs backend/, but this file is not scoped
# to that Dockerfile: it is the one thing standing between "developer runs
# docker build from repo root" and a live secret ending up in an image.
#
# The `**/` forms are not belt-and-braces: .dockerignore patterns are
# anchored at the context root, so the bare `.env` lines below only ever
# matched the repo-root file. apps/shell/.env.local exists on developer
# machines (written for `make dev-web`, holding localhost:20080 and the
# local Zitadel client id) and WAS being copied into Dockerfile.shell's
# builder, where Next.js loaded it — observed live as "Environments:
# .env.local" in the build log. Build args happened to take precedence, so
# it produced a correct image and a false sense of safety; a build that
# omitted one would have silently picked up the localhost value instead of
# failing. Every app directory gets the same treatment.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
dev/zitadel/secrets/

# Node/Next.js build artefacts. These patterns are anchored at the context
# root, so `node_modules/` alone only ever excluded the top-level one — which
# was enough while Dockerfile.api was the only Dockerfile here, and is not
# enough now that Dockerfile.shell builds the pnpm workspace. The `**/`
# variants matter for correctness, not just image size: pnpm's per-package
# node_modules are symlink farms pointing into the root store, so copying
# apps/shell/node_modules into the builder would overlay dangling links on
# top of the install Dockerfile.shell just performed.
#
# Excluding .next/ and *.tsbuildinfo the same way keeps a developer's local
# `next dev` output — built with localhost URLs and whatever client id their
# dev Zitadel assigned — from being copied over a production build.
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.next/
**/.next/
.turbo/
**/.turbo/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/**/dist/
packages/**/dist/

.git/
*.log
coverage/
test-results/
playwright-report/
backend/bin/
